    "text": {
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "text-promise-main",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 0,
          "focusWU": 0.35,
          "endWU": 0.7,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "opener"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "opener-v1",
          "titleStyle": "display",
          "text": "About Me",
          "description": "Creative & Technologist shaping products, interfaces and interactive moments."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-idea",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 0.85,
          "focusWU": 1.25,
          "endWU": 1.65,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "titleStyle": "standard",
          "text": "I’ve always been drawn to complexity."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-conditions",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 1.8,
          "focusWU": 2.2,
          "endWU": 2.6,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "titleStyle": "standard",
          "text": "Especially when something new is changing how we think or behave."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-unit",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 2.85,
          "focusWU": 3.33,
          "endWU": 5.6,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-unit",
            "kind": "stack",
            "moduleGapRem": 4.6,
            "modules": [
              {
                "id": "context",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "These projects rarely arrive as clean design problems. A brief may describe the most visible issue while the harder questions sit beneath it: what the organisation needs, what the product can do and what will make sense to the people using it. Sometimes progress begins by reframing the question itself."
              },
              {
                "id": "education",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "Communication Design taught me to explore those questions through language, image, structure and motion. I became interested in how these elements influence one another—and in finding clarity without simplifying away what matters."
              },
              {
                "id": "practice",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "Consultancy showed me how business needs, user needs and practical constraints can pull the same project in different directions. In startups, I learned to work while both the problem and the product were still evolving. I now treat product, brand and communication as one connected experience."
              },
              {
                "id": "selected-clients",
                "kind": "logo-grid",
                "label": "Selected work across verification, finance, aviation, automotive, hospitality, media and infrastructure.",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "yoti",
                    "label": "Yoti",
                    "src": "/images/about/client-logos/yoti.png",
                    "alt": "Yoti"
                  },
