              {
                "id": "ambitious-teams",
                "kind": "prose",
                "text": "I want to keep working where the direction is still open: on products, services and experiences shaped by new technologies, changing behaviours and emerging ways of thinking. This could mean defining how an unfamiliar technology behaves, how a service earns trust, or how a new capability becomes useful in everyday life. These are the situations where I find design most valuable—while the important decisions are still open and there is room to shape them well."
